# CUE: The CUE Language Specification (cuelang.org/docs/reference/spec); requirements/languages/cue.md
name     cue
keyword  package import let if for in
type     string int float number bool bytes null
builtin  true false _ close len
line-comment   //
string   """ """  : escapes multiline
string   " "      : escapes
string   ' '      : escapes
escape        : paren
operators  +-*/&|!<>=:?.
calls
